<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia O.Y.L. 6-mth net up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia O.Y.L. 6-mth net up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	44.40     vs	36.38</p>
<p>    Net profit		  56.59     vs	44.74</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,548.87     vs   1,436.49</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    80.20     vs	79.54</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  1.85     vs less  1.45</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    less  8.61     vs less 14.43</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	  12.0	vs	10.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is O.Y.L. Industries Bhd. It is a member of the Hong Leong Group.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
